tools.description:
External links attached to a work item.

Actions:
  list (project_id, workitem_id; optional cursor, per_page);
  retrieve (project_id, workitem_id, link_id);
  create (project_id, workitem_id, url; optional title);
  update (project_id, workitem_id, link_id; optional url, title) -- pass at least one of url or title; only the fields you pass are changed;
  delete (project_id, workitem_id, link_id).

url must be http:// or https://. title is the text Plane shows in place of the URL, e.g. title='Design spec' for a long Figma link; without one the URL itself is shown.

